0 // ================================================================
0 // 1 stud = 20 LDU.  Footprint x[-220,220] = 22 studs,
0 //                   z[-400,400] = 40 studs.   -Y is up.
0 // West facade + twin towers : z -400 .. -280
0 // Nave with aisles, flying buttresses : z -280 .. 380
0 // East (apse) wall : z 380 .. 400 ; fleche over the roof ridge
0 // Stone = 71 light bluish grey ; roof/lead = 72 dark bluish grey
0 // Stained glass = trans 33/34/36/41/46/57
0 // ALL ELEMENTS ARE BRICKS STACKED IN 24 LDU COURSES FROM THE GROUND
0 // ================================================================
